# Same line endings on Windows and on the Linux build machine (GitHub Actions).
* text=auto eol=lf

# The DartConnect archive is evidence. Git must never rewrite a single byte of it
# (no line-ending conversion, no "helpful" normalisation) -- on any operating system.
# `**` reaches every season directory: data/seasons/<id>/recaps/*.json and the rest.
data/**/*.json -text

# Binary assets: never diffed or converted.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
